  "project_description": "This module provides seamless integration with Laposta , a leading email marketing service based in the Netherlands. Laposta Subscribe makes it effortless for your website users or visitors to manage their subscriptions to your email list, allowing them to easily opt in. The module enables you to create and manage a subscription form directly from your Drupal site. Key features include:\n\n Features \n \n Simple API integration with Laposta \n Newsletter subscription form \n Configuration through Drupal's admin interface \n Support for Honeypot \n Form validation and error handling \n Twig template included \n \n Supporting this Module \n Miix.dev \n\n Back to top",
